	// DefaultInputTransform An optional jq expression applied to the tool's input after argument overrides merge with the agent's arguments and before the tool runs.
	// Use this to inject server-side context (session metadata, agent secrets) into the tool input, or to reshape the agent's arguments.
	//
	// The expression receives the standard runtime context: the same `agent`, `session`, `tools`, and `currentDate` values exposed to `argument_override` `$ref`s. It also receives an `args` field that contains the merged tool input.
	// The output of the expression replaces `args` as the tool input.
