	// returns its default attribute set. Returned attributes land in two places on each
	// record. They are rendered into the user's profile document, which the agent converts
	// and indexes. They also populate the record's source_record_metadata in the agent
	// session metadata, where they are available for attribute-based filtering and for
	// tool argument overrides. Narrowing this list therefore narrows both what is indexed
	// and what is available as metadata. An attribute the service provider marks as
	// returned only on request is included only when named here.
